  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAGCOT Centre Ltd 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAGCOT centre, support to agriculture development Tanzania, private sector and smallholders&#x2019; economic empowerment. Supporting green growth in agriculture business, climate smart agriculture, (adaptation and mitigation), soil health. Advocacy on enabling environment for private sector development, social and environmentally sustainable value chains. Facilitates linkages between farmers, off-takers, domestic and export market</narrative>
  </description>
